# M6 mode 1 (co-op) with four players: three virtual controllers and the
# keyboard's right half (P4, arrows). Every player moves; same-tick
# presses on three controllers become turns in SDL delivery order.
size 854x480
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
solve
idle 900
key escape
key down 3
key enter
idle
key down 4
key enter
expect state join
pads 3
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
pad 3 a
key enter
expect state join Coop players=4
expect log join p4 keys right
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
pad 3 a
key enter
wait 50
expect state multi Coop players=4 views=1 | v0 p1,p2,p3,p4
idle
p1 press up
p2 press down
p3 press up
p4 press down
p4 press up
expect log turn p4 Move { dir: 1, you: 2 }
chord up 1 2 3
chord down 3 2 1
shot 01-coop-4
p4 press pause
expect state menu=Pause
shot 02-coop-4-pause-p4
p4 press back
p1 press pause
p1 press down 3
p1 press wait
idle
expect state title
quit
